        "introduction": "",
        "about_me": "Hello! My name is Rukhshona and I speak 5 languages. I am bilingual in Tajik and Russian. Additionally I have advanced level of English, Turkish and German. I am a student and in my free time I enjoy teaching languages. When I am not teaching languages, I like to play tennis and travel. I love working with people and teaching languages gives me such an amazing opportunity to meet unique individuals every day. I am excited to be working with you!",
        "about_teacher": "I have been teaching for the past 4 years. I have experience with people of all ages and nationalities. I have worked as a private tutor and for a big online company. I have helped them to prepare for an interview in a foreign language and get the scholarship, improve their speaking skills for a family vacation abroad and ace standardized tests. No matter what their goal is, I put 100% of my energy and effort to bring the most positive outcome from their experience.",
        "teaching_style": "Do you want to be confident with speaking a certain language but also tired of receiving homework? Do you feel like learning a language became an unpleasant task instead of fun activity? Do you want to feel excited every time you practice your target language? You came to the right place. My teaching style is very flexible. In our first lesson we will set goals and make the most effective plan to achieve them. We can have a relaxed free of homework lessons with a lot of interacting activities or a speaking class discussing your favorite movie. The information can be presented in forms of presentations, videos, images, audio files, etc. I promise one thing - it will never be boring!",
